  "description": "A .NET Standard 2.0 library for interacting with KeyCloak's Management API and Phase Two Organizations extension. Provides a similar API structure to Auth0.ManagementApi for easier migration from Auth0 to KeyCloak. Supports user, role, client, group, and organization management operations.",
